<title>HUNGARY: CESI INDEX DIPS TO FINISH AT 1,407.94 POINTS.</title>
<headline>CESI INDEX DIPS TO FINISH AT 1,407.94 POINTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index gave up 6.88 points or 0.49 percent to finish at 1,407.94 points on Friday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungrian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
